    "sections": {
        "description": "The Career Development theme is designed with a structured and responsive layout for presenting educational, training, and professional growth-related content in an organized manner. It includes customizable homepage sections, banner areas, content blocks, testimonial sections, and contact information integration. The theme supports navigation menus, widget-ready areas, social media links, and customization options for colors, typography, and layout settings. It is compatible with commonly used plugins and maintains consistent performance across different screen sizes and devices. The homepage layout allows clear presentation of programs, articles, resources, schedules, and informational content. Additional features include blog integration, image display options, footer customization, and flexible section arrangements for maintaining a clean and user-friendly website structure."
    },
